1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,180
(Zack:)Score.

2
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:04,150
I got an Archie,
Betty and Veronica,

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,450
and a Jughead.

4
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:08,620
(Zack:)All set
for my weekend number twos.

5
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,660
(Sheldon:)Congratulations.

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:15,300
(Sheldon:)Zack, how would you
like to be Superman?

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,500
(Zack:)I don't know, sounds like
a lot of responsibility.

8
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,540
(Leonard:)Fine, if Zack's going
to be Superman,

9
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,940
(Leonard:)I want to be
Green Lantern.

10
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:26,910
(Raj:)But I'm Green Lantern.

11
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,330
(Leonard:)You can be Aquaman.

12
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,660
(Raj:)I don't want to be Aquaman.

13
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,860
(Raj:)He sucks.

14
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:34,980
(Raj:)He sucks
underwater.

15
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,790
(Raj:)He sucks
fish pee.

16
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:39,960
(Sheldon:)Excuse me,

17
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:43,360
(Sheldon:)I believe Aquaman uses
his telepathic powers

18
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:47,660
(Sheldon:)to request the fish do
their business elsewhere.

19
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,270
(Zack:)Hey, babe.

20
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:50,350
(Penny:)I'm still mad at you.

21
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:51,330
(Zack:)Well, you won't be

22
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,440
(Zack:)when you hear the great news.

23
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,470
(Penny:)What great news?

24
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:55,070
(Zack:)We're going to
a costume party

25
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:57,610
(Zack:)at the comic book store
on New Year's Eve,

26
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:01,020
(Zack:)and you get to
be Wonder Woman.

